## 5. `provenance`

```jsonc
"provenance": {
  "type": "object",
  "required": ["actor", "actor_role", "run_id", "source", "recorded_at"],
  "properties": {
    "actor":       { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
    "actor_role":  { "$ref": "#/$defs/actor_role" },
    "run_id":      { "type": "string", "pattern": "^run:[0-9A-HJKMNP-TV-Z]{26}$" },
    "source": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["type", "ref"],
      "properties": {
        "type": { "enum": ["derivation", "observation", "ingestion", "ratification"] },
        "ref":  { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 }
      },
      "unevaluatedProperties": false
    },
    "recorded_at": { "$ref": "#/$defs/timestamp" }
  },
  "unevaluatedProperties": false
}
```

`actor_role` is what `INV-TZ-1` keys on: only `founder` may produce a `Z0` node, matching
`constitution/README.md:3` ("its only legal writer is `kernel/amendment.py`").

